    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1580" root="ايد" body-key="A">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آدَ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَئِيدُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَيْدٌ</span>, <i>He,</i> (a man, AZ, T,
&amp;c.,) or <i>it,</i> (a thing, L,) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, strong:</i>
(AZ, T, S, M, K, &amp;c.:) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آيد</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِيَادٌ</span>,
<i>he became possessed of strength.</i> (AHeyth, T, L.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آدَتٌ ضِيَافَتُهُ</span> (tropical:)  <i>His coming as a guest was,</i> or
<i>became, frequent.</i> (A.) [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَيِّدٌ</span>.]

